<title>FRANCE: Primagaz 1996 turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Primagaz 1996 turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 9,259  vs  7,330</p>
<p>    - of which fourth quarter	  2,854  vs  2,187</p>
<p>NOTE - Primagaz gave the results in a statement.</p>
